{"unit_id":"LazyRa__dsh-session-trash#card-zh","repo":"LazyRa/dsh-session-trash","commit":"da23cd2e4d2970f3c5ca3f9607ce28d9b910fa6b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-trash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回收站插件。它在会话行菜单和侧栏面板中提供可恢复删除管理，并通过 Host 端 API 与浏览器界面协作。删除时把会话及相关缓存移入回收站，支持撤销、按标题或路径搜索、恢复到原工作区，以及彻底删除和批量清空；过期条目会定时清理。遇到运行中的会话会先检查活动状态并要求确认。适合需要整理会话列表、挽回误删或释放本机存储的 DSH 用户；无需 API Key，数据保存在 DSH home。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-31","lib/trash-service.js:404-425","lib/client.js:52-99"]}
{"unit_id":"LazyRa__dsh-session-trash#card-en","repo":"LazyRa/dsh-session-trash","commit":"da23cd2e4d2970f3c5ca3f9607ce28d9b910fa6b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-trash adds a trash panel and deletion menu to DSH Web. Deleted sessions move to local trash, where users can undo, search, restore them, or delete them permanently. Active sessions are checked first, and expired entries are cleaned on a schedule. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-31","lib/trash-service.js:404-425","lib/client.js:52-99"]}
